{"id":"2025-national-1-17","year":2025,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"全国1卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":17,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图所示的四棱锥 $ P - ABCD $ 中，$ PA \\perp \\text{平面} ABCD $，$ BC \\parallel AD $，$ AB \\perp AD $. ； 证明：平面 $ PAB \\perp \\text{平面} PAD $；$ PA = AB = \\sqrt{2} $，$ BC = 2 $，$ AD = 1 + \\sqrt{3} $，点 $ P $，$ B $，$ C $，$ D $ 均在球 $ O $ 的球面上. ； 证明：$ O $ 在平面 $ ABCD $ 上；求直线 $ AC $ 与直线 $ PO $ 所成角的余弦值. [图]","options":null,"answer":"（1）证明略；（2）（i）证明略；（ii）$\\frac{\\sqrt2}{3}$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["空间向量","球","异面直线所成角"],"difficulty":"难题","needs_figure":true,"verification_status":"verified_with_figure_dependency","verification_notes":"完整题面由多份独立来源确认；坐标法重算得到球心 O=(0,1,0)（按标准建系）并得夹角余弦 √2/3；原值2/3已修正。","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2025/2025全国1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"4a5702dda207a470840a62c982ab2392362a404e","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"如图所示的四棱锥 \\(P - ABCD\\) 中，\\(PA \\perp \\text{平面} ABCD\\)，\\(BC \\parallel AD\\)，\\(AB \\perp AD\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 证明：平面 \\(PAB \\perp \\text{平面} PAD\\)；\n\\item \\(PA = AB = \\sqrt{2}\\)，\\(BC = 2\\)，\\(AD = 1 + \\sqrt{3}\\)，点 \\(P\\)，\\(B\\)，\\(C\\)，\\(D\\) 均在球 \\(O\\) 的球面上.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 证明：\\(O\\) 在平面 \\(ABCD\\) 上；\n\\item 求直线 \\(AC\\) 与直线 \\(PO\\) 所成角的余弦值.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n\\bitmapfigure[max width=6.0cm]{img/2025/national_paper_1/q17_fig1.png}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）证明略；（2）（i）证明略；（ii）$\\frac{\\sqrt2}{3}$","figure_refs":["img/2025/national_paper_1/q17_fig1.png"],"figure_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation/4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8/img/2025/national_paper_1/q17_fig1.png"],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2025/national_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"8507e87