{"id":"2025-national-1-19","year":2025,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"全国1卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":19,"question_type":"solution","stem":"； 设函数 $ f(x) = 5\\cos x - \\cos 5x $，求 $ f(x) $ 在 $ \\left[0, \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right] $ 的最大值；给定 $ \\theta \\in (0,\\pi) $ 和 $ a \\in \\mathbb{R} $，证明：存在 $ y \\in [a - \\theta, a + \\theta] $，使得 $ \\cos y \\le \\cos \\theta $；设 $ b \\in \\mathbb{R} $，若存在 $ \\varphi \\in \\mathbb{R} $ 使得 $ 5\\cos x - \\cos (5x + \\varphi) \\le b $ 对 $ x \\in \\mathbb{R} $ 恒成立，求 $ b $ 的最小值.","options":null,"answer":"（1）$3\\sqrt3$；（2）证明略；（3）$3\\sqrt3$","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["三角函数","导数","最值","存在性证明"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2025/2025全国1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"4a5702dda207a470840a62c982ab2392362a404e","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 设函数 \\(f(x) = 5\\cos x - \\cos 5x\\)，求 \\(f(x)\\) 在 \\(\\left[0, \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right]\\) 的最大值；\n\\item 给定 \\(\\theta \\in (0,\\pi)\\) 和 \\(a \\in \\R\\)，证明：存在 \\(y \\in [a - \\theta, a + \\theta]\\)，使得 \\(\\cos y \\le \\cos \\theta\\)；\n\\item 设 \\(b \\in \\R\\)，若存在 \\(\\varphi \\in \\R\\) 使得 \\(5\\cos x - \\cos (5x + \\varphi) \\le b\\) 对 \\(x \\in \\R\\) 恒成立，求 \\(b\\) 的最小值.\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）$3\\sqrt3$；（2）证明略；（3）$3\\sqrt3$","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2025/national_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"8507e8744e6b1505058eb5ce76cb996c597feea9","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"ecd698ecbc35e9ea6700c826ad40ef995225ef